          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "jaque"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " o una amenaza, que el rival tiene que atender. Aquí la dama negra acaba de capturar en "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d2"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". En lugar de recuperarla ya, la torre de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e1"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " captura en "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " con jaque; el rey se aparta, y solo entonces la otra torre recupera la dama. Las blancas ganan una torre entera."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "When the rival takes a piece, the natural thing is to take it back at once. But sometimes there is something better first: an "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "intermediate-move",
            "text": "in-between move"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", almost always a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "check"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " or a threat, that the rival has to answer. Here the black queen has just taken on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d2"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Instead of taking her back now, the rook on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e1"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " takes on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e8"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " with check; the king steps aside, and only then does the other rook take the queen back. White wins a whole rook."
          }
        ]
      },
